{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocket_directive", "label": "websocket()-Route-Direktive", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Serverseitiges WebSocket ist Teil des HTTP-Route-DSL und komponiert mit path(), concat() und withMiddleware(); laeuft auf allen drei Backends."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketserveractor", "label": "WebsocketServerActor (Hub)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Actor pro Route sieht die Events jeder Verbindung serialisiert; onReceive ist versiegelt - pro Verbindung spawnt das Framework einen internen Connection-Actor als Kind, der den Socket besitzt. Typparameter aus Server-Sicht: TOut sendet der Server, TIn empfaengt er."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketconnection", "label": "WebsocketConnection", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Erweitert ActorRef<TOut> und traegt id, upgrade-Kontext und isOpen - laesst sich aber NICHT death-watchen; onClientDisconnected ist das einzige geordnete End-of-Life-Signal pro Verbindung."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketrouteoptions", "label": "WebsocketRouteOptions", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Praezedenz Route-Optionen > actor-ts.http.websocket > eingebaute Defaults, aufgeloest beim Binden - ein ungueltiger Wert ist ein Fehler in bind() und nicht erst beim ersten Upgrade."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxframebytes", "label": "maxFrameBytes", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zweimal geprueft: im Transport (Frame wird abgewiesen, WAEHREND er eintrifft, Client sieht 1006, weil die Laufzeit auflegt) und im Connection-Actor am vollstaendigen Frame vor dem Dekodieren (1009). Nur die zweite Ebene ist eine Zusage, die erste erspart dem Prozess die Pufferung. Ein Server hat einen Transport fuer alle Routen, der deshalb das GROESSTE Limit nimmt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_transport_limit_gap", "label": "Zwei Laufzeit/Backend-Paare ohne Transport-Limit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deno.upgradeWebSocket bietet gar kein Payload-Limit; auf Bun mit Express oder Fastify loest der Spezifizierer ws auf Buns eingebauten Shim auf, der maxPayload annimmt und zurueckliefert, aber nicht durchsetzt - gemessen erreichte ein 2-MiB-Frame gegen ein 1-MiB-Limit den Handler unversehrt, waehrend Node ihn am Socket abwies. Fuer einen aus dem Internet erreichbaren Endpunkt gehoert dort ein Proxy mit eigenem Frame-Limit davor."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_allowedorigins", "label": "allowedOrigins (CSWSH-Schutz)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Browser haengen Cookies automatisch an ein Upgrade an - eine Route mit ambienter Auth ist damit CSWSH-anfaellig. Ein vorhandener, nicht gelisteter Origin wird vor dem Handshake mit 403 abgelehnt; ein FEHLENDER Origin wird zugelassen, da CSWSH ein reiner Browser-Angriff ist. BearerTokenAuth ist bereits geschuetzt, weil Browser beim Handshake keinen Authorization-Header setzen koennen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_middleware_at_upgrade", "label": "Middleware laeuft zur Upgrade-Zeit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Einmal gegen den HTTP-Upgrade-Request, nicht pro Nachricht - deshalb gated Auth-Middleware den Handshake. Backend-eigene Middleware (Fastify-Hooks, app.use) laeuft ebenfalls; der Guard des Frameworks laeuft nach allen anderen und hat das letzte Wort."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_jsoncodec", "label": "jsonCodec", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default-Codec; nimmt optional ein validate, um eingehende Frames gegen ein Schema zu pruefen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_rawcodec", "label": "rawCodec", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fuer Binaerprotokolle - TOut = TIn = WebsocketFrame."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketdecodeerror", "label": "WebsocketDecodeError / onInvalidMessage", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Policy close (1003), drop oder hook - 'hook' leitet Dekodier-Fehler an den Actor weiter statt zu schliessen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_per_connection_ordering", "label": "Reihenfolge pro Verbindung", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "onClientConnected, dann null oder mehr onMessage in Frame-Reihenfolge, dann genau ein onClientDisconnected - alles auf einem Actor, also keine nebenlaeufige Handler-Ausfuehrung und keine Locks."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_hub_mailbox_bound", "label": "Die Mailbox des Hubs begrenzen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Musterfall fuer eine begrenzte Mailbox (Produzent, den du nicht kontrollierst) - aber eine Begrenzung verwirft eingehende Frames und die Signale onClientConnected/onClientDisconnected, ein begrenzter Hub kann also einen Client liefern, der nie in this.clients erscheint, oder einen, der sie nie verlaesst. Erst maxConnections und maxFrameBytes, dann withMailboxCapacity."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_undroppable_spawn_command", "label": "Das Spawn-Kommando einer Verbindung ist nicht verwerfbar", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nimmt dieselbe Spur wie ein Terminated der Death Watch: hinten eingereiht, aber von jeder Overflow-Policy ausgenommen. Es wird genau einmal aus dem Upgrade-Callback gesendet und traegt die einzige Referenz auf einen bereits gehandshakten Socket - es zu verlieren liesse den Socket aufgewertet zurueck, ohne Listener, mit belegtem maxConnections-Platz."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxconnections", "label": "maxConnections", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Begrenzt die Eingabe (wie viele Peers sich verbinden duerfen) statt den Rueckstau - vorzuziehen gegenueber einer Mailbox-Kapazitaet, die bereits angenommene Nachrichten verwirft."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_backpressure", "label": "Backpressure bei langsamen Clients (maxBufferedBytes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ab maxBufferedBytes (Default 4 MiB) verwirft die Verbindung Frames (drop, Default) oder wird geschlossen; Broadcasts an viele langsame Clients sind der Ort, wo das zubeisst."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocket_directive", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketserveractor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocket_directive", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketrouteoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketrouteoptions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxframebytes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketrouteoptions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxconnections", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketrouteoptions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_allowedorigins", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_transport_limit_gap", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxframebytes", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketserveractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketconnection", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_per_connection_ordering", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketserveractor", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_hub_mailbox_bound", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketserveractor", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_undroppable_spawn_command", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_hub_mailbox_bound", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_hub_mailbox_bound", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxconnections", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_jsoncodec", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketdecodeerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_rawcodec", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_jsoncodec", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_middleware_at_upgrade", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_allowedorigins", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_backpressure", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketconnection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_undroppable_spawn_command", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_undroppable_notification", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_hub_mailbox_bound", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_mailboxes_withmailboxcapacity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_hub_mailbox_bound", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_mailboxes_unbounded_default", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_maxframebytes", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_intro_installation_hono_node_ws_floor", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocket_directive", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_backends_express_ws_handshake_through_app", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_websocket_websocketserveractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_death_watch", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/websocket.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}